                "details": "Setting p_min=0.5 increases acceptance to 64.1% at 47.9 tok/s. Setting p_min=0.9 achieves 100% acceptance on verified tokens.",
                "best_setting": "p_min = 0.5 (Balanced Throughput & Acceptance)"
            },
